<title>FINLAND: FINNISH Q3 BANKRUPTCIES UP THREE PERCENT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>FINNISH Q3 BANKRUPTCIES UP THREE PERCENT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of bankruptcies increased by nearly three percent year-on-year to 1,044 in July-September, Statistics Finland said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
<p>In January-September, the number of bankruptcies at 3,329 was almost seven percent lower than in the year-ago period, it said.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
